                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:3em;\"><strong>Paul de Tarse (env. 5-67 apr. J.-C.) - Apôtre chrétien</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\">INFORMATIONS UND EXERCISES</span></strong></p>\n"
